/URI (data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22840%22%20height%3D%221440%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20840%201440%22%20role%3D%22img%22%20aria-labelledby%3D%22hk-plate-title%22%3E%3Ctitle%20id%3D%22hk-plate-title%22%3EHelikon%3A%20source%20geometry%20and%20the%20four-string%20retuning%20experiment%3C%2Ftitle%3E%3Cmetadata%3EAn%20ideal%20geometric%20and%20listening%20experiment%20after%20Ptolemy%2C%20Harmonics%20II.2.%20Uniform%20strings%20share%20the%20same%20full-length%20pitch%3B%20a%20zero-width%20bridge%20sets%20their%20sounding%20lengths.%20Tension%2C%20material%2C%20bridge%20height%20and%20coupling%20are%20held%20outside%20this%20model.%20Sine%20tones%2C%20absolute%20reference%20pitch%20and%20the%20four-string%20retuning%20exercise%20are%20modern%20choices.%20This%20is%20not%20a%20reconstruction%20or%20a%20measurement%20of%20an%20ancient%20instrument.%0ACopyright%20%C2%A9%202017%20IBM%20Corp.%20with%20Reserved%20Font%20Name%20%26quot%3BPlex%26quot%3B%0D%0A%0D%0AThis%20Font%20Software%20is%20licensed%20under%20the%20SIL%20Open%20Font%20License%2C%20Version%201.1.%0D%0A%0D%0AThis%20license%20is%20copied%20below%2C%20and%20is%20also%20available%20with%20a%20FAQ%20at%3A%20http%3A%2F%2Fscripts.sil.org%2FOFL%0D%0A%0D%0A%0D%0A-----------------------------------------------------------%0D%0ASIL%20OPEN%20FONT%20LICENSE%20Version%201.1%20-%2026%20February%202007%0D%0A-----------------------------------------------------------%0D%0A%0D%0APREAMBLE%0D%0AThe%20goals%20of%20the%20Open%20Font%20License%20\(OFL\)%20are%20to%20stimulate%20worldwide%0D%0Adevelopment%20of%20collaborative%20font%20projects%2C%20to%20support%20the%20font%20creation%0D%0Aefforts%20of%20academic%20and%20linguistic%20communities%2C%20and%20to%20provide%20a%20free%20and%0D%0Aopen%20framework%20in%20which%20fonts%20may%20be%20shared%20and%20improved%20in%20partnership%0D%0Awith%20others.%0D%0A%0D%0AThe%20OFL%20allows%20the%20licensed%20fonts%20to%20be%20used%2C%20studied%2C%20modified%20and%0D%0Aredistributed%20freely%20as%20long%20as%20they%20are%20not%20sold%20by%20themselves.%20The%0D%0Afonts%2C%20including%20any%20derivative%20works%2C%20can%20be%20bundled%2C%20embedded%2C%20%0D%0Aredistributed%20and%2For%20sold%20with%20any%20software%20provided%20that%20any%20reserved%0D%0Anames%20are%20not%20used%20by%20derivative%20works.%20The%20fonts%20and%20derivatives%2C%0D%0Ahowever%2C%20cannot%20be%20released%20under%20any%20other%20type%20of%20license.%20The%0D%0Arequirement%20for%20fonts%20to%20remain%20under%20this%20license%20does%20not%20apply%0D%0Ato%20any%20document%20created%20using%20the%20fonts%20or%20their%20derivatives.%0D%0A%0D%0ADEFINITIONS%0D%0A%26quot%3BFont%20Software%26quot%3B%20refers%20to%20the%20set%20of%20files%20released%20by%20the%20Copyright%0D%0AHolder\(s\)%20under%20this%20license%20and%20clearly%20marked%20as%20such.%20This%20may%0D%0Ainclude%20source%20files%2C%20build%20scripts%20and%20documentation.%0D%0A%0D%0A%26quot%3BReserved%20Font%20Name%26quot%3B%20refers%20to%20any%20names%20specified%20as%20such%20after%20the%0D%0Acopyright%20statement\(s\).%0D%0A%0D%0A%26quot%3BOriginal%20Version%26quot%3B%20refers%20to%20the%20collection%20of%20Font%20Software%20components%20as%0D%0Adistributed%20by%20the%20Copyright%20Holder\(s\).%0D%0A%0D%0A%26quot%3BModified%20Version%26quot%3B%20refers%20to%20any%20derivative%20made%20by%20adding%20to%2C%20deleting%2C%0D%0Aor%20substituting%20--%20in%20part%20or%20in%20whole%20--%20any%20of%20the%20components%20of%20the%0D%0AOriginal%20Version%2C%20by%20changing%20formats%20or%20by%20porting%20the%20Font%20Software%20to%20a%0D%0Anew%20environment.%0D%0A%0D%0A%26quot%3BAuthor%26quot%3B%20refers%20to%20any%20designer%2C%20engineer%2C%20programmer%2C%20technical%0D%0Awriter%20or%20other%20person%20who%20contributed%20to%20the%20Font%20Software.%0D%0A%0D%0APERMISSION%20%26amp%3B%20CONDITIONS%0D%0APermission%20is%20hereby%20granted%2C%20free%20of%20charge%2C%20to%20any%20person%20obtaining%0D%0Aa%20copy%20of%20the%20Font%20Software%2C%20to%20use%2C%20study%2C%20copy%2C%20merge%2C%20embed%2C%20modify%2C%0D%0Aredistribute%2C%20and%20sell%20modified%20and%20unmodified%20copies%20of%20the%20Font%0D%0ASoftware%2C%20subject%20to%20the%20following%20conditions%3A%0D%0A%0D%0A1\)%20Neither%20the%20Font%20Software%20nor%20any%20of%20its%20individual%20components%2C%0D%0Ain%20Original%20or%20Modified%20Versions%2C%20may%20be%20sold%20by%20itself.%0D%0A%0D%0A2\)%20Original%20or%20Modified%20Versions%20of%20the%20Font%20Software%20may%20be%20bundled%2C%0D%0Aredistributed%20and%2For%20sold%20with%20any%20software%2C%20provided%20that%20each%20copy%0D%0Acontains%20the%20above%20copyright%20notice%20and%20this%20license.%20These%20can%20be%0D%0Aincluded%20either%20as%20stand-alone%20text%20files%2C%20human-readable%20headers%20or%0D%0Ain%20the%20appropriate%20machine-readable%20metadata%20fields%20within%20text%20or%0D%0Abinary%20files%20as%20long%20as%20those%20fields%20can%20be%20easily%20viewed%20by%20the%20user.%0D%0A%0D%0A3\)%20No%20Modified%20Version%20of%20the%20Font%20Software%20may%20use%20the%20Reserved%20Font%0D%0AName\(s\)%20unless%20explicit%20written%20permission%20is%20granted%20by%20the%20corresponding%0D%0ACopyright%20Holder.%20This%20restriction%20only%20applies%20to%20the%20primary%20font%20name%20as%0D%0Apresented%20to%20the%20users.%0D%0A%0D%0A4\)%20The%20name\(s\)%20of%20the%20Copyright%20Holder\(s\)%20or%20the%20Author\(s\)%20of%20the%20Font%0D%0ASoftware%20shall%20not%20be%20used%20to%20promote%2C%20endorse%20or%20advertise%20any%0D%0AModified%20Version%2C%20except%20to%20acknowledge%20the%20contribution\(s\)%20of%20the%0D%0ACopyright%20Holder\(s\)%20and%20the%20Author\(s\)%20or%20with%20their%20explicit%20written%0D%0Apermission.%0D%0A%0D%0A5\)%20The%20Font%20Software%2C%20modified%20or%20unmodified%2C%20in%20part%20or%20in%20whole%2C%0D%0Amust%20be%20distributed%20entirely%20under%20this%20license%2C%20and%20must%20not%20be%0D%0Adistributed%20under%20any%20other%20license.%20The%20requirement%20for%20fonts%20to%0D%0Aremain%20under%20this%20license%20does%20not%20apply%20to%20any%20document%20created%0D%0Ausing%20the%20Font%20Software.%0D%0A%0D%0ATERMINATION%0D%0AThis%20license%20becomes%20null%20and%20void%20if%20any%20of%20the%20above%20conditions%20are%0D%0Anot%20met.%0D%0A%0D%0ADISCLAIMER%0D%0ATHE%20FONT%20SOFTWARE%20IS%20PROVIDED%20%26quot%3BAS%20IS%26quot%3B%2C%20WITHOUT%20WARRANTY%20OF%20ANY%20KIND%2C%0D%0AEXPRESS%20OR%20IMPLIED%2C%20INCLUDING%20BUT%20NOT%20LIMITED%20TO%20ANY%20WARRANTIES%20OF%0D%0AMERCHANTABILITY%2C%20FITNESS%20FOR%20A%20PARTICULAR%20PURPOSE%20AND%20NONINFRINGEMENT%0D%0AOF%20COPYRIGHT%2C%20PATENT%2C%20TRADEMARK%2C%20OR%20OTHER%20RIGHT.%20IN%20NO%20EVENT%20SHALL%20THE%0D%0ACOPYRIGHT%20HOLDER%20BE%20LIABLE%20FOR%20ANY%20CLAIM%2C%20DAMAGES%20OR%20OTHER%20LIABILITY%2C%0D%0AINCLUDING%20ANY%20GENERAL%2C%20SPECIAL%2C%20INDIRECT%2C%20INCIDENTAL%2C%20OR%20CONSEQUENTIAL%0D%0ADAMAGES%2C%20WHETHER%20IN%20AN%20ACTION%20OF%20CONTRACT%2C%20TORT%20OR%20OTHERWISE%2C%20ARISING%0D%0AFROM%2C%20OUT%20OF%20THE%20USE%20OR%20INABILITY%20TO%20USE%20THE%20FONT%20SOFTWARE%20OR%20FROM%0D%0AOTHER%20DEALINGS%20IN%20THE%20FONT%20SOFTWARE.%0D%0A%0AMIT%20License%0A%0ACopyright%20\(c\)%202026%20Anton%20Soloviev%0A%0APermission%20is%20hereby%20granted%2C%20free%20of%20charge%2C%20to%20any%20person%20obtaining%20a%20copy%0Aof%20this%20software%20and%20associated%20documentation%20files%20\(the%20%26quot%3BSoftware%26quot%3B\)%2C%20to%20deal%0Ain%20the%20Software%20without%20restriction%2C%20including%20without%20limitation%20the%20rights%0Ato%20use%2C%20copy%2C%20modify%2C%20merge%2C%20publish%2C%20distribute%2C%20sublicense%2C%20and%2For%20sell%0Acopies%20of%20the%20Software%2C%20and%20to%20permit%20persons%20to%20whom%20the%20Software%20is%0Afurnished%20to%20do%20so%2C%20subject%20to%20the%20following%20conditions%3A%0A%0AThe%20above%20copyright%20notice%20and%20this%20per